<title>USA: Tyco International says sets 2-for-1 split.</title>
<headline>Tyco International says sets 2-for-1 split.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tyco International Ltd's board of directors  declared a two-for-one common stock split.</p>
<p>Tyco said The split will be in the form of a 100 percent stock distribution,  payable on Oct 22 to shareholders of record on Oct 1.</p>
